Third-party voice
-----------------

The agent's default voice is "Jenny (Dioco)", the Piper voice
en_GB-jenny_dioco-medium trained on the Jenny TTS dataset by Dioco
(https://github.com/dioco-group/jenny-tts-dataset). Its licence requires
software and voice interfaces that use it to credit the voice as "Jenny" and,
where practical, "Jenny (Dioco)"; commercial use is permitted. The voice is
downloaded by Piper at run time and is not part of this repository. A copy of
the dataset's terms as relied on is in docs/third-party/.

Credits in recordings
---------------------

Not required, but appreciated: if you publish audio or video made with this
project, please credit "Made with AI on the Line" with a link to the
repository, and "Voice: Jenny (Dioco)" if you used that voice. Recordings
downloaded from the call page carry this credit by default.
